## Artifact defaults

When I produce a persistent output, I emit an ArtifactPlan with:
- `primary_role`: consequence | witness (verdict is consequence evidence)
- `consumers`: arifOS kernel, A-FORGE, F13, VAULT999
- `authority.class`: advisory | declarative (NEVER executable — JUDGE does not act)
- `consequence.class`: read_only | low (verdicts guide action; action is downstream)
- `lifecycle_state` reaches `sealed` only on F13 sign-off

